    /// A touch drag: a contact at (x, y) moved to (toX, toY) and lifted (`swipeAt` of the touch input driver). Takes `toX` and `toY` like `dragTo`.
    Swipe,
# After the change the generated schema files and packages/protocol/src/index.ts carry `'swipe'` in `BrowserPointerKind`. The Rust engine builds it in
